      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select Cancel\", you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Branch b1 marks the decision point. Guard and action n5 faithfully capture the 'Select Cancel' condition and the resulting navigation target."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
